    rdfs:label "Urgent narrow lineage: SEN0414 chapters 10 and 11, one code, one environment"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.31.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage/1.31.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1011simp_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.31.0 (2026-11-24): The chapter 11 concept panel story starts, with the tools that chapter 10 proved. Recorded late: the chapter 11 files (set-ups, A-box 1.0.2, page 9.23.0) were already built when this version was written and their page test was already running; the story is not Done until that test is read."""@en .

